---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="页面不存在 · BUCT One">
  <section class="wrap section nf">
    <div data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">404</p>
      <h1>这块玻璃后面没有内容</h1>
      <p class="lead">你访问的页面不存在或已移动。回首页看看，或直接下载 App。</p>
      <div class="nf-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/" data-jelly>回首页</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/download" data-jelly>去下载</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .nf { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; align-items: center; min-height: 60vh; }
  .nf > div { display: grid; gap: 16px; }
  .nf-cta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }
</style>
